# Everything in this folder runs on Linux (WSL or Docker), so text files keep Unix line endings (LF), also in a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true. A shell or Python script with Windows line endings does not start
# ("bad interpreter", "$'\r': command not found"), and the Docker image copies entrypoint.sh as it is.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pgm binary
*.bin binary
*.glb binary
